<title>USA: Duluth, Minn., $1.285 mln won by Firstar.</title>
<headline>Duluth, Minn., $1.285 mln won by Firstar.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Firstar Bank said it won $1.285 million of Duluth, Minn., general obligation tax increment bonds, Series 1996 D, with a net interest cost of 4.882 percent.</p>
</text>
